# Repo root. The Next.js app has its own app/.gitignore; this covers what lands
# at the top level.
#
# This file did not exist until 2026-08-19, which is why node_modules/ was
# committed at the root: `npm install` was run here once (there is a root
# package-lock.json), and with nothing ignoring it two build artefacts went in.
node_modules/

# Vitest/Vite caches, which is what actually got committed.
.vite/
